          "value": "Taken with Sony ILCE-7RM4|Images with annotations|Self-published work|Images with extracted images|Images with 10+ annotations|ISO speed rating 50|Photographs with aspect ratio of 3:2 by PantheraLeo1359531|ISO speed rating 50 by PantheraLeo1359531|Computer-related photographs created by PantheraLeo1359531|Taken with Sony ILCE-7RM4 by User:PantheraLeo1359531|Centrifugal computer cooling fans|Taken with Sony FE 24-70mm F2.8 GM by PantheraLeo1359531|Photographs by PantheraLeo1359531 taken in photoboxes|Photographs created by PantheraLeo1359531 on 2023-04-05|Disassembled Nintendo Switch Console",
